# Sparkle EdDSA signing keys (generated locally by `generate_keys`).
# Private key MUST NEVER be committed — keep it in macOS Keychain + GitHub Secret only.
# This whole folder stays local; see secrets/README.md for the upload-to-GitHub-Secret procedure.
secrets/

