# Xcode per-user UI state (scheme ordering in the picker, window/breakpoint state).
# Per-user and machine-specific — the *shared* schemes live in xcshareddata/ (which CI's
# `-scheme` uses). xcschememanagement.plist was tracked historically and only churned noise
# (e.g. when a new target adds a scheme entry); stop tracking it.
*.xcuserstate
xcuserdata/


